### Try the API from IntelliJ IDEA or VS Code (REST Client extension), or copy the curl lines.
### Start the app first: mvn spring-boot:run

### Module 06: list books (paged, filtered, sorted)
# curl "http://localhost:8080/api/books?title=java&sort=price,desc&size=5"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?title=java&sort=price,desc&size=5

### Module 06: one book
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### Module 07: a missing book returns a Problem Details body
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999

### Module 13: log in (users: reader/reader-pass, admin/admin-pass)
# curl -X POST localhost:8080/api/auth/token -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"username":"admin","password":"admin-pass"}'
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "admin-pass"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Module 13: create a book (admin only)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Clean Architecture", "isbn": "978-0-13-449416-6", "price": 39.99, "stock": 5, "authorId": 2}

### Module 07: invalid input lists every bad field
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "", "isbn": "123", "price": -1, "stock": -5}

### Modules 10 and 19: place an order, safe to retry with the same Idempotency-Key
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 7f9c2a40-first-try
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"bookId": 1, "quantity": 2}, {"bookId": 3, "quantity": 1}]}

### Module 10: my orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Module 17: price in another currency (calls an external exchange-rate API)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1/price?currency=INR

### Module 18: health, info and metrics (metrics need the admin token)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

###
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/metrics/bookstore.orders.placed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Module 19: the OpenAPI document (Swagger UI: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html)
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
